{
  "EI": [],
  "SN": [
    {
      "id": "58964",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "text": "灰的。我刚摸过，里面厚，领口也不扎。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc01-02"
    },
    {
      "id": "58966",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "text": "好看是好看，可你上次骑马，脖子让硬领磨红了。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc01-04"
    },
    {
      "id": "58982",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "text": "先别换。我昨日拨灯芯，它就亮了，底座也没漏油。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc04-02"
    },
    {
      "id": "58984",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "text": "我关窗试过。换根灯芯看看，不成再买。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc04-04"
    },
    {
      "id": "58988",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "text": "你各弹一小段给我听。光听他说，我分不出来。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc05-02"
    },
    {
      "id": "58990",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "text": "后一段尾音发尖，倒是旧的听着舒服。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc05-04"
    },
    {
      "id": "58992",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "text": "先用旧的。价钱贵，听着不顺也没用。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc05-06"
    }
  ],
  "TF": [
    {
      "id": "58995",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "text": "我听见笑声就走了，以为你也瞧不起我。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc06-03"
    },
    {
      "id": "59011",
      "ordinal": 48,
      "text": "你说被管事责备了？我去找他。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc09-01"
    }
  ],
  "JP": [
    {
      "id": "58970",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "text": "先别定。我明日回来看看街上有什么。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc02-02"
    },
    {
      "id": "58972",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "text": "记得。这次饿了就先吃，不必非等那一家。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc02-04"
    },
    {
      "id": "58975",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "text": "雨停了，今日别坐车，去河边走走。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc03-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "58977",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "text": "路上见河边起了雾，忽然想去。灯明日也能看。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc03-03"
    },
    {
      "id": "59006",
      "ordinal": 43,
      "text": "练完骑射就去。沿河有新摊子，我想边走边看。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc08-02"
    },
    {
      "id": "59008",
      "ordinal": 45,
      "text": "行，见面再定去哪儿，别替我排满一晚上。",
      "author": "吕布",
      "self": true,
      "fixtureMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v1-dc08-04"
    }
  ]
}
